135	// resolution per connector. Like the system class it refuses to create the
136	// file — a missing placeholder means the template release predates
137	// development definitions (and its pinned Intropy.Topology has no
138	// IDevelopmentDefinition), so it reports false and the caller degrades the
139	// connector and system-class shapes to that era instead of failing.
140	func writeDevelopmentFile(dir string, m *Model, warnf func(format string, args ...any)) (bool, error) {
